WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Bedroom. Laptop open. Notification: accepted to Verdaly.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
Family dinner. Confetti. A quick warm flash.

00:10.000 --> 00:16.000
Apartment exit. Cab door. City sound rises.

00:16.000 --> 00:26.000
Cab exit. Bustling street, briefcases, calls, traffic.

00:26.000 --> 00:34.000
Look up. VERDALY tower sign above the entrance.

00:34.000 --> 00:45.000
Walk to the grand doors. Breath in. Start your first day.
